# Update the Changelog

- After completing a substantive code, UI, database, configuration, or tooling change, update `CHANGELOG.md`.
- Use `python3 scripts/changelog.py --type <Added|Changed|Fixed|Removed|Security|Database> --message "<summary>"`.
- Record user-visible outcomes, database migrations, deployment requirements, and important developer tooling changes.
- Group closely related edits into one concise entry and do not add duplicate entries.
- Do not log read-only investigation, explanations, formatting-only edits, or failed attempts.
